  "describe": "Clock 2026-11-02. Phone: November 2026 and Personal, Mon to Sun, the 1st under Sunday, 2 in a filled circle with three dots under it, one dot under 5 and 12, weekends grey; then Monday 2 November, Today, and four events with times and coloured bars. Landscape 640x360: same month left, the agenda as a panel right. Desktop and tablet: big cells, 2 outlined and tinted with the four events as chips (tablet: two chips and +2 more), Book club on 5 and Ana's birthday on 12. tap-12: 12 selected, the agenda shows Thursday 12 November, All day, Ana's birthday. mono: the same in black, white and grey.",
